    "verdict_notes": "Arditi et al. is cited only in related work, as an over-refusal reference. VA is Wang et al. 2024 (arXiv:2410.03415), which builds on refusal-direction work, but this paper neither describes nor tests that construction. The t-SNE representation analyses use layer-10 representations of harmful and boundary-safe QA pairs, not a refusal direction."
